  "No objective. The strategy says: 'Start Death Star, Twilek for an effect depending on your opponent's start' (suggesting Crush The Rebellion when in doubt); starting.card is the Death Star system and Twi'lek Advisor the starting Interrupt. Total 60 as published.",
